{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is an early preview of Budget Rally, the arcade rally racing game where you take regular cars for a spin instead of the usual rally legends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo invites racers to try out three different cars on two tracks in a simple time trial race mode. Both tracks include the main and the reverse routes, totalling four courses to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RETRO VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614990/extras/handling.gif?t=1745776698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring aesthetics from the golden era of rally racing games!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE CARS TO CHOOSE FROM<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614990/extras/demo_cars.gif?t=1745776698\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo includes a front wheel drive sedan, an all wheel drive station wagon and a rear wheel drive pickup truck to try out different handlings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURING TWO UNIQUE TRACKS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614990/extras/tracks.gif?t=1745776698\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out the cars in a hot desert canyon or go high up into the snow covered mountains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614990?t=1745776698","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614990?t=1745776698","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614990/951f28facd56a6c18645d104d9ec712cd51cc1ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745776698","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614990/951f28facd56a6c18645d104d9ec712cd51cc1ae/ca